xtras/6f6f6a1909cdfa8c9354d324b8617709.mp4?t=1787340182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADORABLE BUT SOMEHOW DEADLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support for up to four players, you’ll each take control of one of four wholesome heroes. Each of them is adorable, but somehow they’re all also pretty deadly, even if they don’t look it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capy </strong>- Comes from an ancient, peace-loving civilization of advanced capybaras. He’s pretty chill but he’s got a job to do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moody </strong>- Built like a tank and fights like one too. A hippo that has definitely seen some wild things but will not talk about them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jim </strong>- Fast, aggressive and only possibly house-trained. Often more chaos than dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axie </strong>- Who doesn’t love an Axolotl that is prepared to support their whole team? Probably doesn’t get enough credit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what squad you end up with, you’ll be fighting through surreal worlds and stacking up character builds that start out ‘a little weird’ and end up as ‘truly ridiculous and a little alarming’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/679a1880e0454c3c4cfd9e81b4498705.poster.avif?t=1787340182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/679a1880e0454c3c4cfd9e81b4498705.webm?t=1787340182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/679a1880e0454c3c4cfd9e81b4498705.mp4?t=1787340182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THINGS WILL GET OUT OF HAND AND THAT’S OK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a series of maps with different objectives - things like zone defence, elimination arenas, mini-boss fights and more - and the chaos builds with every new world you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map cleared adds a new layer - power-ups stack, wearables boost your stats and by the time you reach the end of a run, your build that started simple has become complete chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/a13cdde4db99e596fa34ae6c866943e7.poster.avif?t=1787340182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/a13cdde4db99e596fa34ae6c866943e7.webm?t=1787340182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/a13cdde4db99e596fa34ae6c866943e7.mp4?t=1787340182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND IT ONLY GETS WEIRDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new world you visit, you’ll see something new and surreal. From an oversized casino with hostile playing cards and ATMs that can really do some damage, to a nightmare carnival with a giant clown that launches bumper cars, things start strange and only get bizarre - and we haven’t even mentioned the weaponized golf cart yet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/adc9f0cfe1f591b0fba81fa3e377cab3.poster.avif?t=1787340182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/adc9f